<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Smith Barney starts retail sector.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Smith Barney starts retail sector.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Steven Kim began coverage of the retail sector, with only Gadzooks Inc winning a buy rating, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Stocks rated outperform were Gap Inc, TJX Cos Inc, Lands' End Inc, Ross Stores Inc and Talbots Inc, the source said.  </p>
<p>-- Kim confirmed the initiations. He also started coverage of Intimate Brands Inc with an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Stocks rated neutral were the Limited Inc, Gymboree Corp, and AnnTaylor Stores Corp.  </p>
<p>-- Shares of Gadzooks jumped 1-1/4 to 34-1/2.</p>
</text>
